# FishE - home: "You sit in your rented room, polishing one of your prized
# fishing poles." Midday, when the sun keeps the fish deep. No figures are
# drawn: the pole lies on the table with a rag. Provisional art (RFC 0025):
# see stills.json.
size 640 360
camera 5.0 4.4 5.4  -0.5 0.7 -0.9  50 0.1 200
lighting sun 0.5 54 4 2048 30 0.6 1
clear 0 0 0 1 sky
include _room.scene
